## Model card

- **Name:** Step 5 Preview
- **Short description:** StepFun’s Step 5 Preview is described in local metadata as a 1M-context MoE model for agentic coding and knowledge work, available in preview with API and NVIDIA NIM access paths.
- **Provider / access:** StepFun API and NVIDIA NIM/Build surfaces (per local metadata). Local metadata lists `opencode/step-5-preview` and `noFreeId`.
- **Release / knowledge:** Release and knowledge cutoff not independently verified from accessible official public sources in this pass.
- **IDs:** `step-5-preview`.
- **Context window:** 1M total (1,000,000 in / 64K out) per local metadata.
- **Modalities:** Text, image, video input; text output (local metadata).
- **Pricing (as of 2026-11-10):** $1.00 / $2.70 per MTok ($0.10 cache hit) per local metadata; free prototyping endpoint on NVIDIA NIM noted. Not independently verified in detail in this pass.
- **Architecture:** 600B total / 27B active MoE per local metadata; not independently verified in this pass.

